"Dragon Veins are vast rivers of Qi running through the earth from horizon to horizon."
"Qi Shock can be cured by meditating and offering one's Qi to a Dragon Vein."
"Qi given freely and without restraint to soil can flow back to the giver over time."
"A garden tended with real love exhales faint clouds of gentle ambient Qi, like life itself."
"The world's ambient Qi has weakened every year since the Age of Heroes."
"Draining Qi yields fewer new cultivators and fewer Imperial Realm masters with each age."
"Sages reckon the world has thousands of years left before its draining Qi becomes truly dire."
